# Avahi MQTT Service Discovery - Quick Start
#
# 1. Make the installer executable:
chmod +x install-mqtt-service.sh
#
# 2. Run it:
./install-mqtt-service.sh
#
# This deploys conf/mqtt.service to /etc/avahi/services/ and restarts avahi-daemon.
# The Pi will then broadcast _mqtt._tcp on port 1883 for mDNS discovery.